# Visual style

Source of truth: `concepts/ART_DIRECTION.md`.

## World

- Near-black sky/background and light-gray court floor (`#C3C3C3`)
- Side walls + ceiling: subtle transparent cyan glass
- Ball / blobs / net: bright albedo + soft emission (not high bloom)
- Blue side = cyan; red/AI side = magenta; ball/score = yellow
- Dark ground-shadow discs pinned under ball/blobs (exactly on floor)
- Soft ambient smoke behind court + light fog (atmosphere only)
- Sparse floating ash motes through play volume (Upside-Down vibe)
- Restrained glow; preserve crisp silhouettes

## UI

- Near-black panels/backgrounds
- Cyan borders and focus; magenta active accents
- Secondary copy uses muted steel blue
- Must remain readable on phone landscape

## Never

- Daylight sky, green hills, brown court
- Opaque bright arena boundaries
- Bloom that hides object edges
